":"「陛下……"}],"5:1:10177:6:0":[{"kind":"text","text":"「"},{"kind":"control","value":2},{"kind":"text","text":"諸葛瑾"},{"kind":"control","value":1},{"kind":"text","text":"，\n　你也去\n　準備出征吧。"}],"5:1:10177:7:0":[{"kind":"text","text":"「……是。\n　既然是\n　陛下的命令……"}],"5:1:10629:0:0":[{"kind":"text","text":"「父親，\n　請帶我一起\n　前往"},{"kind":"control","value":3},{"kind":"text","text":"江陵"},{"kind":"control","value":1},{"kind":"text","text":"。"}],"5:1:10666:0:0":[{"kind":"text","text":"「嗯？"}],"5:1:10666:1:0":[{"kind":"text","text":"「聽說我的堂弟"},{"kind":"control","value":2},{"kind":"text","text":"諸葛瞻"},{"kind":"control","value":1},{"kind":"text","text":"\n　在蜀軍中\n　十分活躍。"}],"5:1:10666:1:1":[{"kind":"control","value":1},{"kind":"text","text":"「我很想\n　和他\n　交手一次。"}],"5:1:10666:1:2":[{"kind":"control","value":1},{"kind":"text","text":"「請您\n　帶我同行。"}],"5:1:10666:2:0":[{"kind":"text","text":"「真是的，\n　你這孩子……"}],"5:1:10666:2:1":[{"kind":"text","text":"「你這不服輸的性子，\n　與其說像我，\n　倒更像"},{"kind":"control","value":2},{"kind":"text","text":"孔明"},{"kind":"control","value":1},{"kind":"text","text":"。"}],"5:1:10666:2:2":[{"kind":"control","value":1},{"kind":"text","text":"「……沒辦法，\n　看來我是\n　攔不住你了。"}],"5:1:10666:2:3":[{"kind":"control","value":1},{"kind":"text","text":"「還有這場戰爭……"}],"5:1:10666:3:0":[{"kind":"text","text":"「那麼，\n　您答應\n　讓我去了嗎？"}],"5:1:10666:4:0":[{"kind":"text","text":"「嗯……\n　……一定要\n　活著回來啊。"}],"5:1:10957:0:0":[{"kind":"text","text":"「謝謝父親！"}],"5:1:10957:0:1":[{"kind":"text","text":"「身為您的兒子，\n　我一定會奮勇作戰，\n　不讓您蒙羞！"}]}}
